    "name": "Premier Place Surabaya Airport",
    "detail": "The hotel is only 6 mins from airport. Hotel staff are very friendly, courteous and service oriented. I didnt realise that they provide free airport transfer. During check in, the staff arranged hotel to airport transfer for me for the next morning. The rooms are very clean, bed is very comfortable. Shower was of good size and water pressure were excellent with constant hot water supply. Breakfast buffet was served early at 6am, comprising of local Surabaya food which was delicious. However, there were some flies around, so this could be an area of improvement. Highly recommend to stay here. ",
